  "description": "White forward; from under the forward fuselage a red line and a gold band sweep up to the window line and on aft, where the red rises over the crown so the whole rear fuselage is red, the gold sweeping down beneath it to the belly. Red fin with the golden Dapeng bird (concentric feather arcs and a big wing stroke ending in a spiral). Red winglets with the gold bird. The small Dapeng emblem, '海南航空' and 'Hainan Airlines' in red over the forward windows; a small 'HNA' badge behind the cockpit; doors outlined in red-orange.",
